<CalloutContainer slot="cards">
    <CalloutCard title="Heads  up - Extra!">
        <p>
            <strong> Torsion of thin-walled hallow shafts </strong> builds on this content.
            </p>
            <p>
                In general, the maximum shear stress is given by 
                
                <DisplayEquation equation="\\phi = \\frac{TL}{GJ}\\"/>

                For thin-walled shafts 
                
                <DisplayEquation equation="\\tau_{max} = \\frac{T}{2tA_m}\\"/>

                where 
                
                <DisplayEquation equation="\\begin{align} A_m &= \\pi R_{ave}^2 \\\\ R_{ave} &= \\frac{R_o + R_i}{2} \\end{align}"/>

                Note that is NOT the cross sectional area of the hollow shaft!
            </p>
        </CalloutCard>
